  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a pot over medium heat until shimmering.",
    "Add the chopped onion and sauté until translucent, about 3 minutes.",
    "Stir in garlic, smoked paprika, cumin, and cinnamon; cook until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
    "Mix in tomato paste and vanilla extract, cooking for 2 minutes to develop depth.",
    "Add the rinsed lentils, vegetable broth, and water, then bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce heat to low, cover, and simmer until lentils are soft and stew is thick, about 20 minutes.",
    "Season with salt and pepper, adjust consistency with extra water if needed.",
    "Serve hot garnished with a drizzle of olive oil and a sprinkle of fresh herbs if desired."
